  "instructions": [
    "heat 1 tablespoon of butter in the donabe over medium heat",
    "add the onion and cook for 2-3 minutes until softened",
    "add the white rice and cook for 1-2 minutes until lightly toasted",
    "add the chicken broth, lemon zest, dried dill weed, salt, and black pepper, stir well",
    "add the cox apple to the donabe and stir to combine",
    "bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and cover the donabe",
    "simmer for 15-20 minutes until the liquid has been absorbed and the rice is tender",
    "fluff the pilaf with a fork and top with chopped fresh parsley"
